  "details": "When you try the avatar in game it shows pink for a split second in menu then defaults to no material\nHow to replicate:\n1.- Make a fresh project, switch to android platform and import sdk(skip this if you already have a project)\n2.- Create Diffuse material add whatever texture to it and slap it on a cube or whatever mesh\n3.- Upload that as an avatar\nJust like that it all seems fine in unity but in VRChat it doesn't work at all\n\n.\n.\n\nPlatform: Quest 1\nCurrent VRChat build version: 1061",
